     {
      "text": "Revenue surged 56% sequentially from ₹1,975 Cr in Dec 2025 to ₹3,076 Cr in Sep 2026 while PAT nearly quadrupled from ₹100 Cr to ₹398 Cr.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management targets 14-15% EBIT margin, a significant improvement over the current 12.5% operating margin.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-11-01:p11",
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Debt-to-equity remains low at 0.27 with management guiding it won't exceed 1.0 despite planned capex of ₹3,200 Cr this year and ₹3,000 Cr in 2027-28.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR",
       "T:2026-08-01:p19",
       "T:2026-08-01:p16"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Three-year CAGR shows revenue declining -0.4% and PAT falling -13.5% with operating margin compressing from 16.2% to 12.5%.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "ROCE is only 11% while the company plans massive capex of ₹3,200 Cr in FY26 and ₹3,000 Cr more in FY27-28.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR",
       "T:2026-08-01:p15",
       "T:2026-08-01:p16"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Operating cash flow to PAT ratio over three years is just 0.99, indicating poor cash conversion.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     }
    ]
